(pasta, uncooked, spaghetti or other long noodles) 8 oz
(mushrooms, shitake preferred; white or portabello or maitake alternatives) 12 oz
(garlic, minced) 2 cloves
(yellow onion, small, minced) 1
(butter) 2 Tbsp
(general purpose flour) 1 Tbsp
(vegetable broth) 1 Cup
(dijon mustard) 1 Tsp
